    "Se caen las costras": "The scabs fall off",
    "Primera revisión y primer lavado normal. En trabajos de oficina, casi todos han vuelto ya.": "First check-up and first normal wash. Most people with office jobs are already back at work by now.",
    "Mes 1 a 3": "Month 1 to 3",
